      <title>替罪羊与王座：一个女性精神结构的星盘、文学与命运</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/posts/2026/04/%E6%9B%BF%E7%BD%AA%E7%BE%8A%E4%B8%8E%E7%8E%8B%E5%BA%A7%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%A5%B3%E6%80%A7%E7%B2%BE%E7%A5%9E%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%E7%9A%84%E6%98%9F%E7%9B%98%E6%96%87%E5%AD%A6%E4%B8%8E%E5%91%BD%E8%BF%90/</link>
